{"3669720": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Bakery Cafe Simulator: Prologue", "steam_appid": 3669720, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the first few hours of “Bakery Cafe Simulator” solo or with up to 4 players online.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this prologue you'll find <strong>10 recipes</strong> to cook for your customers, including various coffee recipes and a few pastries such as cookies and cakes. <strong>Thirty or so customization elements</strong> for your store will also be available, allowing you to let your imagination run wild as you personalize your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1784627730\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build and furnish your café according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1784627730\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1784627730\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Experience the first few hours of “Bakery Cafe Simulator” solo or with up to 4 players online.</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this prologue you'll find <strong>10 recipes</strong> to cook for your customers, including various coffee recipes and a few pastries such as cookies and cakes. <strong>Thirty or so customization elements</strong> for your store will also be available, allowing you to let your imagination run wild as you personalize your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >About the game mechanics</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.poster.avif?t=1784627730\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.webm?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/62cb1f27500c412cdc6e7b0bf12cbaa1.mp4?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Build and furnish your café according to your desires. Place tables for customers, decorate and organize your kitchen to be productive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.poster.avif?t=1784627730\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.webm?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e59e8ec2729a9fdeaa6951bd622aadaf.mp4?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Manage your orders for raw materials so you always have something to offer your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.poster.avif?t=1784627730\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.webm?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/extras/e204bc77307d57d9f7a3f20ae6be1d0e.mp4?t=1784627730\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span>Enjoy a varied and demanding culinary experience. Be careful not to keep customers waiting, they could become unhappy.</p>", "short_description": "Start bake, build, and grow your dream bakery cafe with prologue now! Create delicious pastries, design your space, and serve customers. Play solo or with friends in online co-op to expand your business and experience the excitement of running a bustling cafe!", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong>, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Japanese, Polish, Portuguese - Portugal, Russian, Simplified Chinese, Turkish<br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/6b8a63f40e5a18acd3f5ca60151efce001ee3946/header.jpg?t=1784627730", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/dd0fc5616b4e4abd52173f87eac746efd2dc0f7f/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1784627730", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3669720/dd0fc5616b4e4abd52173f87eac746efd2dc0f7f/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1784627730", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10, 11<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-3470<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 12<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 20 GB available space</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": [], "linux_requirements": [], "developers": ["Meerkatt Studio"], "publishers": ["Meerkatt Studio"], "package_groups": [], "platforms": {"windows": true, "mac": false, "linux": false}, "categories": [{"id": 2, "description": "Single-player"}, {"id": 1, "description": "Multi-player"}, {"id": 9, "description": "Co-op"}, {"id": 38, "description": "Online Co-op"}, {"id": 22, "description": "Steam Achievements"}, {"id": 62, "description": "F